# Purpose

This document defines the performance engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish architectural principles that deliver responsive user experiences, efficient resource utilization, and sustainable system performance as the platform grows in complexity and scale.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Performance philosophy
* Performance architecture
* Resource efficiency
* Scalability principles
* Performance governance
* Performance evolution

It intentionally excludes implementation techniques, framework-specific optimizations, infrastructure tuning, and benchmarking tools, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to performance, ensuring responsiveness is achieved through sound architecture rather than isolated optimizations.

